sets \eqn{V} depend on \code{similarity_type}: with \code{"complete"}, they are all
the nodes of the clusters (\eqn{D_a = |V_a|}, \eqn{D_b = |V_b|}); with
\code{"partial"}, only the nodes present in both windows count
